Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyUrbanDriving" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow vehicle ahead in foggy conditions" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to fog" .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Significant occlusion of road and surrounding objects due to dense fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Foggy conditions reducing visibility and increasing collision risk" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision risk due to limited visibility of vehicle ahead" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Significant occlusion of road and surrounding objects due to dense fog
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Foggy conditions reducing visibility and increasing collision risk
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 3:**
Description: Potential rear-end collision risk due to limited visibility of vehicle ahead
Severity Score: 0.75

---
The scene was classified as a **StateAnomaly** due to the abnormal weather condition (fog) affecting the driving environment. The vehicle is the primary **Actor** in this context, and the **RoadObject** represents the reduced visibility caused by fog. The identified risks include **OcclusionRisk**, **WeatherRisk**, and **RearEndCollisionRisk**, each with an assigned severity score reflecting their potential impact on driving safety.